  fingerprint='Design only: exact builtin types,recursive bounded shapes before allocation,immutable snapshots bracketed by fresh source/code/default/global/import guards and cold/reuse validation; never trust class.__name__ alone. Independently derive all11 facts from authenticated AST data and verify commitments. Do not promote advisory digest to runtime acceptance.',
